notes: >
  §5.2: an unreachable module proxy is ENV_FAIL — the code never compiled, and the fix is the
  environment. Reported by Go on a `main.go:3:8:` line, which the old `^go: `-anchored predicate
  missed. Asserts the verdict only: message text varies by Go version and by transparent proxies.
requires: [go]
argv: ['--all']
exitCode: 1
gates:
  golang:build: { status: env-fail }
